[
{
"id": 20507,
"en": "And if it bends the knee to Hiroshima,\nthe Tojo Clan will wither and die.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20508,
"en": "Even after the sixth chairman gets out of prison,\nSugai won't just hand back the throne.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20509,
"en": "He may have grand plans, but he's just\nan antique trying to stay relevant.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20510,
"en": "He's apparently searching for\nHaruka Sawamura and her child as well.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20511,
"en": "My advice is that you take both of them and\nhide somewhere far away for a long time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20512,
"en": "I'll repay you for this someday.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20513,
"en": "I'd rather you forget, actually.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20514,
"en": "Once I've wrested control of the Tojo from Sugai,\nyou and I will need to settle things for good.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20515,
"en": "And I won't make you wait long.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20516,
"en": "(If Someya's telling the truth, the Hirose Family\nis in danger. I have to go tell them!)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20517,
"en": "Hey, look! That's Kiryu!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20518,
"en": "Go n' get him!\nWhoever takes his head's gettin' promoted!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20519,
"en": "Fight like yer life depends on it!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20520,
"en": "You're okay!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20521,
"en": "Wh-What's up, Aniki?\nY'look like ya jus' saw a ghost.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20522,
"en": "Where're the girls?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20523,
"en": "Well, they jus' left.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20524,
"en": "Okay. I assume they're still safe, but\nI'll need you to call them just in case.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20525,
"en": "For the time being, they should\nprobably leave Onomichi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20526,
"en": "The Yomei Alliance and\nthe Tojo Clan are coming for us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20527,
"en": "It's because we revealed the secret of Onomichi.\nApparently Daidoji's not too pleased with that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20528,
"en": "G-Gotcha!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20529,
"en": "I'll drop a line over to Moreno.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20530,
"en": "Aniki, we got guests. Looks like main family guys.\nOnly a handful of 'em, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20531,
"en": "Didn't these shits learn their lesson at the shipyard?\nI'm gettin' real tired of bein' underestimated.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20532,
"en": "No, this is just the scouting party.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20533,
"en": "Every yakuza in Hiroshima is coming for us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20534,
"en": "We told the ladies where t'go.\nThey'll be safe fer now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20535,
"en": "If we stick together, we can win this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20536,
"en": "These fools... Let's make them regret\never setting their sights on our family.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20537,
"en": "Aniki, did... Did y'just say \"our\" family?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20538,
"en": "I don't know about you,\nbut that's how I've felt since I got here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20539,
"en": "All right, let's crush 'em!\nThis one's fer Patriarch Hirose!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20540,
"en": "These fuckin' fuckheads...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20541,
"en": "Keep an eye outside for me.\nI need to get in touch with Yuta.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20542,
"en": "Why Yuta?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20543,
"en": "The Tojo Clan is coming for Haruka.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20544,
"en": "They mean business, too. I doubt\nthe police hospital will be safe anymore.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20545,
"en": "Tagashira. More o' those main family guys'll\nprobly swing by. Keep an eye on the streets.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20546,
"en": "Aniki? It's Yuta.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20547,
"en": "Right. How is everything over there?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20548,
"en": "It's going pretty good.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20549,
"en": "Oh yeah, Haruto stood up today without\nany help from either of us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20550,
"en": "He may even walk soon!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20551,
"en": "Great.\nIs Date-san with you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20552,
"en": "I need you to tell him something.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20553,
"en": "He needs to move Haruka\nsomewhere safe, as soon as possible.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20554,
"en": "Far away from Kamurocho, if he can.\nMaybe even outside of Tokyo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20555,
"en": "But what kinda place would be\nsafer than a police hospital?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20556,
"en": "On top o' that, Haruka-chan just woke up.\nShe's still not in the greatest shape.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20557,
"en": "It'd be tough to move her right now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20558,
"en": "That makes sense. Okay then,\nI'll head back as soon as I can.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20559,
"en": "But tell Date-san to start searching\nfor a safer hideout. This is important.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20560,
"en": "Will do.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b23|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20561,
"en": "You heard all that, right? I'm bound for Kamurocho.\nNagumo, what's your plan?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20562,
"en": "We're goin' with.\nWe gotta protect Haruka-chan n' her baby.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20563,
"en": "That's how the boss woulda wanted it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20564,
"en": "Okay then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20565,
"en": "We still gotta prep a bit, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20566,
"en": "If I had to guess, it'll be real tough\nto come back this way now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20567,
"en": "Don't leave anythin' undone\nbefore we roll out, Aniki.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20568,
"en": "We'll drop by yer apartment later.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20569,
"en": "(The Hirose guys are meeting me here.\nAm I ready to leave Onomichi behind?)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20570,
"en": "(All right, I'm ready.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20571,
"en": "(I just have to wait for them now.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20572,
"en": "(I still have things to do.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20573,
"en": "(I should walk the town a little more.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20574,
"en": "I'll be damned...\nThis is Kamurocho, huh?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20575,
"en": "Y'can't light up here, Tagashira.\nThem's the rules.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20576,
"en": "This place ain't like back home.\nY'gotta mind yer manners. Ain't that right, Aniki?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20577,
"en": "Take these two over to Serena, Nagumo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20578,
"en": "I'm going to catch a taxi to the police hospital.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20579,
"en": "The heck, Kiryu-aniki? Y'mean we came\nt'Tokyo jus' to sit on our asses?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20580,
"en": "Don't backtalk him, Tagashira.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20581,
"en": "This shit's important fer Kiryu-aniki. He hasn't\ntalked t'Haruka-chan in years. Respect up.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20582,
"en": "Thanks for that, Nagumo. I appreciate it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20583,
"en": "S'all good. N' don't worry 'bout comin'\nback late. Take yer sweet time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20584,
"en": "Welcome back, Kiryu-san.\nGlad to see you're safe.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20585,
"en": "Date-san and I are on the hunt for somewhere\nto stash Haruka-chan. Sounded urgent.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20586,
"en": "Did you manage to find anything?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20587,
"en": "More or less.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20588,
"en": "Remember we're going up against\nthe Yomei Alliance and Tojo Clan here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20589,
"en": "They can never, ever find Haruka.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20590,
"en": "I get it. Then staying in one place\nis probably out of the picture, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20591,
"en": "She might have to move around a bit\nto keep them off her trail.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20592,
"en": "Am I... putting you in danger again?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20593,
"en": "No, that's not it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_snack01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20594,
"en": "So much happened while you were asleep.\nThey're coming for me this time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20595,
"en": "It's my fault. You wouldn't be in danger if not for me.\nStill... I'm going to do something about it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20596,
"en": "You, Haruto, and even Yuta...\nI need to make sure you can live together in peace.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20597,
"en": "Huh? Uh, well, only if Haruka-chan's\ninto the idea, of course.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20598,
"en": "Why wouldn't I be into the idea?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20599,
"en": "Are y'sure?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20600,
"en": "Hey, Kiryu-san. I think you and I are\nthe third and fourth wheels here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20601,
"en": "Wait, you're actually leaving?\nI was kidding, man.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20602,
"en": "Hold on, Aniki!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20603,
"en": "It's fine.\nI have a call to make.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20604,
"en": "A call? Who to?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20605,
"en": "It's Kiryu.\nSomeya. Can you talk?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20606,
"en": "I can. How are you, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20607,
"en": "I didn't call to make small talk.\nJust tell me where Iwami and Sugai are.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20608,
"en": "Unfortunately, I'm not sure of Iwami's whereabouts.\nSugai is over in the Millennium Tower, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20609,
"en": "His office is up on the top floor.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20610,
"en": "I see. Thanks.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b03|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20611,
"en": "Hold on. What are you planning?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20612,
"en": "Are you going to see Sugai?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20613,
"en": "You won't be able to talk your way out of this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20614,
"en": "As you know, Tsuneo plans on delivering your head\nto Daidoji as proof of his commitment to their cause.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20615,
"en": "From his standpoint,\nnegotiations are off the table.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20616,
"en": "I'd advise that you stay off his radar\nuntil Daidoji takes his last gasp.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20617,
"en": "It couldn't be much longer now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20618,
"en": "If I were the only one this affected,\nmaybe I would.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20619,
"en": "But I'm not. I can't run if it means\nabandoning everyone close to me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20620,
"en": "So then...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20621,
"en": "Fourth Chairman... You can't be serious.\nAre you... planning to kill Sugai and Tsuneo?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20622,
"en": "I'm shocked. I never thought the day would come\nthat the Dragon of Dojima killed a man.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20623,
"en": "I heard that's against your policy.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20624,
"en": "I never said I was a saint.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20625,
"en": "In that case, a word of caution.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20626,
"en": "Sugai has escape routes throughout\nthe Millennium Tower.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20627,
"en": "Even if you managed to reach his office, you would\nnever be able to block off all of them by yourself.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20628,
"en": "He could sneak away with ease.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20629,
"en": "That so? I got it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20630,
"en": "Yuta. I'll be needing your help.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20631,
"en": "We're going to the Millennium Tower to take Sugai down.\nYou should go meet up with the others at Serena.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20632,
"en": "R-Right, I'm on it!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20633,
"en": "Can you look after Haruka for me?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20634,
"en": "I think not, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20635,
"en": "The Dragon of Dojima's back in Kamurocho busting heads\nlike the good old days, and you want me to babysit?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20636,
"en": "If you want someone to look after Haruka-chan,\nDate-san and the police have it covered.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20637,
"en": "After all, you can't take the police on this one.\nBut you can take me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20638,
"en": "The Hirose Family and I... We already have Sugai\ncoming after us. You shouldn't get involved.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20639,
"en": "Don't gimme the short straw, man.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20640,
"en": "Besides, I had to sit and watch Kamurocho\ngo to hell after Sugai took over as chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20641,
"en": "I couldn't stop him, though. All I did was\nsit on my garbage throne in the sewers.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20642,
"en": "This is my chance to get back at Sugai.\nConsider me the Kamurocho representative.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20643,
"en": "And I'm not letting this opportunity pass.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20644,
"en": "I'm going with you, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20645,
"en": "And don't even try to pretend\nlike you don't need me there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20646,
"en": "I'd rather have you than a hundred other guys.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20647,
"en": "I'll be waiting over at Serena, too. If you don't\ncome soon, it'll be you who gets left behind.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20648,
"en": "I'm going to borrow Yuta for a bit.\nI need his help with something.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20649,
"en": "I'll bring him back safe.\nI promise you that.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20650,
"en": "But... what about you, Uncle Kaz?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20651,
"en": "I'll be fine, too. Of course.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20652,
"en": "You have a good kid here.\nHe looks like his mother.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20653,
"en": "I always wondered when this day would come.\nIt was just way sooner than I expected.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20654,
"en": "If you take the \"Haruka\" kanji from my name,\nand combine it with the \"Yu\" kanji from Yuta's...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20655,
"en": "It reads like \"Haruto.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20656,
"en": "Ah, the \"to\" was Yuta's name...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20657,
"en": "Um... Yuta-kun is a good guy.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20658,
"en": "Yeah, I know... I know.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20659,
"en": "Are you sure? He told me you punched\nhim straight through a door.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20660,
"en": "Hm? Oh, uh... That was, uh...\nHow do I explain...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20661,
"en": "Come back in one piece, okay?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20662,
"en": "You're a great mother already.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20663,
"en": "I guess I can't keep patting\nyou on the head after this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20664,
"en": "But for now, I'm going to make\nsure you stay out of this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20665,
"en": "I'd never forgive myself if I couldn't.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20666,
"en": "I'll see you later, Haruka.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20667,
"en": "(Everyone is waiting for me at Serena.\nI should go meet up with them.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20668,
"en": "(We're about to break into the Millennium Tower.\nI better go into it with no regrets.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20669,
"en": "(Okay, I'm ready to go.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20670,
"en": "(Let's take Sugai down.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20671,
"en": "(I still have some things to do.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20672,
"en": "(I should come back once I'm ready.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20673,
"en": "Yuta told us everythin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20674,
"en": "We're takin' down Sugai from the Tojo Clan, yeah?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20675,
"en": "Yeah. I need to talk to him.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20676,
"en": "But before I do, I'll need your help.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20677,
"en": "I can't wait t'show Kamurocho what's up.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20678,
"en": "We're gonna give these Tokyo shits a taste\no' how we do it down in Hiroshima.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20679,
"en": "This kinda stuff's perfect fer yakuza like us.\nI jus' wish Hirose-san coulda seen it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20680,
"en": "Let's do it, Aniki!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20681,
"en": "Our destination is the Millennium Tower.\nSugai should be on the top floor.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20682,
"en": "Catch him, no matter what.\nWe can't let him escape. Understand?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20683,
"en": "Let's head up!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20684,
"en": "Shit, they just don't stop!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20685,
"en": "We'll stay back n' take care of 'em.\nYou guys keep movin', Kiryu-aniki!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20686,
"en": "Yer fight's with us, y'bastards!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20687,
"en": "Let's go while we still can, Kiryu-aniki!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20688,
"en": "We're done here.\nLet's keep pushin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20689,
"en": "Die!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20690,
"en": "Yuta-kun! Shit!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20691,
"en": "That's one down.\nWho's next?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20692,
"en": "Shit... Y'asshole!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20693,
"en": "Stay there, Yuta!\nDon't move.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20694,
"en": "Hang in there.\nThis won't take long.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20695,
"en": "Yuta-kun!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20696,
"en": "Don't give up!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20697,
"en": "I-It's okay.\nThis is nothing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20698,
"en": "It definitely <font_kind=yakuza_italic>looks</font_kind> like something.\nStay still.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20699,
"en": "We've got important shit to do.\nI can't jus'... lie here like this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20700,
"en": "Akiyama. Can I leave Yuta to you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20701,
"en": "I said stay still!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20702,
"en": "Goddammit...!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20703,
"en": "If you die on me here, I'd never be able\nto face Haruka and Haruto.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20704,
"en": "You need to live.\nLive, and protect your family.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20705,
"en": "Akiyama. He's yours.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20706,
"en": "Be careful up there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20707,
"en": "Who is it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20708,
"en": "The one you seek, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20709,
"en": "I expected you to come here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20710,
"en": "However, I don't have time to play with you today.\nI've delegated that to someone.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20711,
"en": "Where are you!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20712,
"en": "It doesn't matter now where I am!\nKiryu...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20713,
"en": "This is where you die.\nI look forward to watching it happen.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20714,
"en": "So Sugai and his lackeys took Kiyomi-san\nhostage, then killed her right in front of Someya.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20715,
"en": "No... Kiyomi-san...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20716,
"en": "They'll pay!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20717,
"en": "We really gonna take this lyin' down?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20718,
"en": "I know. But we'll have time to talk later.\nWe can't stay here anymore.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20719,
"en": "They'll come for us next.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20720,
"en": "They won't stop until they get revenge\nfor revealing the secret of Onomichi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20721,
"en": "It's dangerous to be all in the same place like this.\nWe need to hide separately for a while.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20722,
"en": "If only we knew where Iwami and Sugai were.\nWe'd have a better chance if we did.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20723,
"en": "Cap?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20724,
"en": "I'm goin' t'get some fresh air on the roof.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20725,
"en": "Kiryu-aniki's right, y'know.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20726,
"en": "By the time I come back down here,\ny'all better be gone.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20727,
"en": "Once things're calmer,\nwe can meet up again.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20728,
"en": "Don't y'get it!? This ain't the time\nt'be sittin' on our asses!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20729,
"en": "Get the fuck outta here!\nI ain't lettin' them kill anyone else, y'hear me!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20730,
"en": "Akiyama. Can you take care of Yuta for me? You should be\nsafe from both the Tojo and the Yomei down in that sewer.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20731,
"en": "How is Haruka doing?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20732,
"en": "Date-san's got a handle on it. He'll probably\nhave her outta the hospital by sundown.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20733,
"en": "If yer still hung up about Kiyomi-san...\nYou need to know it's not your fault.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20734,
"en": "Once I'm healed,\nwe're getting revenge.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20735,
"en": "Mind if I ask you something, Kiryu-san?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20736,
"en": "If Sugai really had been up in the Millennium Tower,\nwhat do you think you would've done?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20737,
"en": "I keep thinking about it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20738,
"en": "I mean, he and Iwami are ready to do\nwhatever it takes to kill you guys.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20739,
"en": "Plus they have no qualms about hurting\nyour friends if it means getting to you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20740,
"en": "And they aren't listening to reason.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20741,
"en": "So, there's only one conclusion, Kiryu-san.\nWhen you saw Sugai and Iwami...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20742,
"en": "...You were going to kill them, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20743,
"en": "But if the Dragon of Dojima gets blood on his hands,\nyou'd be finished as the boss of Kamurocho.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20744,
"en": "Don't you put me on a pedestal.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20745,
"en": "I can't protect my own friends, let alone\nthe whole city. I'm just a washed-up yakuza.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20746,
"en": "You can say that all you want,\nbut I'm not giving up on you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20747,
"en": "If Kamurocho falls to the likes of Iwami\nand Sugai, there'll be no turning back.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20748,
"en": "Right now, this city needs you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 20749,
"en": "Think of your legacy. Think of the history\nyou've etched into the streets of the city.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main13|#",
"max": null
}
]